  "138": {
    "inputs": {
      "value": "<Subject 1> refers to the young woman in Picture 1, featuring black bangs, long dark hair, and a black strapless top.\n<Subject 2> refers to the young woman in Picture 2, featuring a traditional Chinese updo, ornate hair accessories, and a light blue hanfu-style dress.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description:\nA cinematic, live-action sequence shot in a softly lit, modern indoor room with a shallow depth of field. The visual style features large-format cinematography, emphasizing natural skin tones and soft, diffused highlight transitions. The camera maintains a series of tight facial close-ups, using precise shot-reverse-shot editing to establish the dialogue between the two distinct characters.\n\n[Shot 1] A tight close-up of <Subject 1> (S1). The background is a heavily blurred, warm indoor room with soft ambient light. She looks slightly off-camera to the right with a deeply anxious expression, her brows furrowed and eyes wide. She speaks with a fast, breathy voice: (S1) <d>[Chinese] 公子怎么样了？</d>\n[Shot 2] At 00:03.500, the camera cuts to a matching tight close-up of <Subject 2> (S2), maintaining the eye-line match. The indoor background remains softly blurred. She looks slightly off-camera to the left, her expression serene and calm. The camera pushes in with a very small amplitude at a slow speed toward her face. She replies gently: (S2) <d>[Chinese] 还好，已经脱离危险了。</d>\n[Shot 3] At 00:07.000, the camera cuts back to <Subject 1> (S1), keeping the same close-up framing. Her anxiety slightly subsides but she remains deeply concerned, leaning slightly forward toward the camera. She asks quickly: (S1) <d>[Chinese] 那接下来做什么？</d>\n[Shot 4] At 00:10.000, the camera cuts back to <Subject 2> (S2). Her expression softens into a gentle, reassuring smile. The ambient light catches her eyes, highlighting her calm demeanor. She speaks with a steady, comforting voice: (S2) <d>[Chinese] 等公子醒了再说！</d> She holds the reassuring smile, looking steadily toward the left until the end of the video.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nQuiet, warm indoor room tone. The soft rustle of fabric is heard as Subject 1 leans forward at the 7-second mark. Subtle, tense breathing can be heard underneath the first dialogue exchange.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA soft, tense string ostinato plays during the first two shots, reflecting the anxiety. As Subject 2 smiles in the final shot, the strings resolve into a warm, gentle piano chord, bringing a sense of relief and calm."
    },
    "class_type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline",
